UPDATE courses SET
    course_description = '<p style="text-align: justify;">This qualification reflects the role of professionals such as builders, site managers, and managers of small to medium-sized building businesses. These individuals apply their knowledge of structural principles, building codes, standards, and legal requirements to: <br/> <ul> <li>Class 1 and 10 buildings (up to two storeys), and</li> <li>Class 2 to 9, Type C constructions</li> </ul> They are responsible for planning and supervising safe construction work, preparing and managing contracts, and applying quality control measures to building projects.</p> <li>Class 1 and 10 buildings (up to two storeys), and</li> <li>Class 2 to 9, Type C constructions</li> <p style="text-align: justify;">Building involves the actual construction process, while Site Management focuses on managing various external and logistical factors such as crew coordination, compliance with regulations, weather conditions, and site-specific challenges.</p>',
